IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `sla-grants`

-- State Lands Act 1920, ss 9, 11, 13 to 17 and 29 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_state-lands-act-1920.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

